# Qwen3-Coder-30B-A3B-Instruct (mixture of experts, 3B active; Apache-2.0): the model of Sushila CodeGen. One A100 80GB.
# Checked 2026-10-05:
#   - 4-bit for SGLang: QuantTrio/Qwen3-Coder-30B-A3B-Instruct-AWQ (classic AWQ, bf16 scales, 16.8 GB, Apache-2.0;
#     340k downloads). The more popular cyankiwi/...-AWQ-4bit is compressed-tensors format (no Qwen official 4-bit file).
#   - published EAGLE-3 head: lmsys/SGLang-EAGLE3-Qwen3-Coder-30B-A3B-Instruct-SpecForge (MIT), declares 2,048 tokens.
#   - Ollama qwen3-coder:30b = Q4_K_M of this model (gguf_name.py logs its header next to the SGLang file).
MODEL=qwen3-coder-30b-a3b
TARGET=QuantTrio/Qwen3-Coder-30B-A3B-Instruct-AWQ
PUB_HEAD=lmsys/SGLang-EAGLE3-Qwen3-Coder-30B-A3B-Instruct-SpecForge
OLLAMA_TAG=qwen3-coder:30b
SF_TEMPLATE=qwen
CHAT_KWARGS='{}'                                 # no thinking mode in the Coder release
SYSTEM_TURN=0
CTX=2048                                         # the lmsys head declares 2,048 tokens

